          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2087936902456365301",
          "textSnippet": "You can sign this petition to help fix the fact that far too much of our billionaire backed media is owned by people who don't live in this country and have the opposite of our best interests at heart.\n\nWhen it gets to 100,000 Parliament will debate it "
        },
        {
          "id": "2087940526133674459",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-13T16:33:08.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2087940526133674459",
          "textSnippet": "Great to speak to \n@MattChorley\n on BBC Five Live.\n\nWhy hasn't the Prime Minister mentioned the climate crisis at all? What's his plan? And will be rule out drilling for oil & gas in the North Sea?\n\nLuckily Matt is interviewing the PM  on tomorrows show so can we get some answers"
        },
        {
          "id": "2087941926037106890",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-13T16:38:41.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2087941926037106890",
          "textSnippet": "Drilling for oil and gas will absolutely not lower bills. It's sold on the international market.\n\nAnd the idea of this being for jobs is utter nonsense. Jackdaw would create about 27 jobs.\n\nSo when is the moment Andy Burnham will take the heatwaves & the climate crisis seriously?"
        },
